                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Refrigerated trailers, commonly known as reefer trailers, are essential for transporting temperature-sensitive goods. Whether it's fresh produce or life-saving medications, keeping cargo at a consistent temperature ensures it arrives safely, in compliance with health regulations, and ready for distribution. But buying new equipment isn't always necessary. For many businesses, <a href=\"/store/inventory?type=trailer&condition=used\">used reefer trailers</a> offer the performance they need at a significantly lower cost. If you're in one of the following industries, investing in used reefer trailers could be a smart move for your bottom line and your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
