                        {
                          "id": "p-step-1",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "From restaurants and grocery stores to large-scale food suppliers, anyone in the food and beverage industry depends on reliable refrigerated transportation. Used reefer trailers make it easier to maintain a cold chain while staying within budget.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": "p-step-1-2",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "These trailers can carry frozen, chilled, or perishable items like dairy, meat, produce, and beverages, making them a flexible option for a wide range of delivery routes. By opting for a used reefer trailer, food distributors can increase capacity and expand service areas without the overhead of buying new.",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": "full"
