                          "id": "p-step-2",
                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "The pharmaceutical industry has some of the most stringent temperature requirements when it comes to transportation. Medications, vaccines, and medical supplies often need to be kept within a narrow temperature range, and any deviation can result in spoilage or safety concerns. Used reefer trailers are a practical solution for companies needing to grow their fleet quickly and affordably. Many high-quality used models still offer advanced temperature monitoring systems and insulation, making them suitable for sensitive medical cargo.",
