                          "props": {
                            "text": "Flowers and live plants look as delicate as they are. Transporting them safely requires a climate-controlled environment that prevents wilting, dehydration, and other damage caused by extreme heat or cold. For florists, nurseries, and garden centers, used reefer trailers provide a cost-efficient way to move product between growers, stores, and events. Smaller or seasonal businesses especially benefit from used units, which offer flexibility without requiring a large upfront investment.",
