                          "type": "text",
                          "props": {
                            "text": "Grocery stores supply and stock a lot of food, and their customers depend on that food to be of its best quality. Suppliers in this space need reliable cold storage on wheels to deliver quickly and safely. Reefer trailers allow businesses to stage or transport pre-packed boxes, fresh produce, and refrigerated goods directly to consumers.",
