                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-buy-used-reefer-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Choosing to invest in used reefer trailers doesn't mean compromising on quality. Many units on the market have low mileage, updated cooling systems, and solid maintenance histories. For businesses watching their budgets or those looking to get up and running quickly, used trailers offer major value.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-buy-used-reefer-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, we offer a wide inventory of used reefer trailers from trusted manufacturers like Hyundai Translead and more. Each unit is inspected for quality and performance, so you can feel confident that your cargo is protected, your deliveries are on time, and your investment is working hard for your business.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
